// Adaptive Sorting Algorithm Implementation
// This program implements a sorting algorithm that can be evolved to adapt to different data patterns

use std::cmp::Ordering;

// EVOLVE-BLOCK-START
// HYPOTHESIS-1: Removing dead code and simplifying will improve fitness by reducing code length penalty
// MECHANISM-1: The fitness function penalizes code exceeding 500 chars; removing unused functions cuts length significantly
